          "text": "Worry and checking related to partner's safety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Repetitive checking of her partner's location and messages, with worry that something bad will happen and he will not come home."
      }
    },
    {
