          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Avoids being alone outside home; may cancel or delay appointments if her partner cannot accompany her and uses grocery delivery. Avoids public transport and busy indoor spaces alone. Can walk a short distance around the block with her partner."
      }
    },
    {
