          "text": "Sleep disturbance and nightmares"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Difficulty sleeping when her partner is not in the flat; waits awake until he returns. Occasional nightmares about him going missing or having an accident."
